Homepage: https://github.com/fontra/fontra-pak

Package: fontra-pak
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libc6 (>= 2.39)
Description: Standalone desktop application for the Fontra font editor
 Fontra Pak bundles the Fontra font editor (https://github.com/fontra/fontra)
 as a standalone desktop application. This package repackages the official
 PyInstaller-built release tarball rather than rebuilding from source; the
 libc6 dependency reflects the glibc floor of that upstream build (see
 fontra/fontra-pak#276 for why it moved from 2.35 to 2.39).
